  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e39974e2-a368-5971-b60c-9d41c656f264" activityNameId="524756c8-db20-536f-9050-453e3a8f585f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Soft solder, Sn97Cu3, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Soft solder, Sn97Cu3, at plant
The inventory is meant to be used as a background dataset for technical processes using soft solder. The lead-free product investigated is Sn97Cu3 that is made from tin (97%) and copper (3%). The investigation is based on data provided by a producer and information from literature.;
UUID: 9a04086e-d3c2-399a-aa86-f9b959e29b68
Gate to gate including solder mixing and casting, atomisation and paste mixing, including estimate for emissions and infrastructure.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production of lead-free soft solder from metals tin and copper.
Time period: Time of publications. Most data for 2000.
Production volume: 2000t for this product.
Sampling: Questionnaire and literature 
Extrapolations: From one producer to European average.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9a04086e-d3c2-399a-aa86-f9b959e29b68.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
